    "Small LLM-generated, unaudited dataset: indicative only, not reportable until human-audited.",
    "detection_coverage_*: share of sensitive spans the detectors find at all. Categories with no detector (e.g. NATIONAL_ID, MEDICAL, BANK_ACCOUNT) are invisible to every detection-sharing filter, so recall is capped by this, not by the risk model.",
    "precision/recall/f1: over gold spans. A span counts as protected if its text no longer appears in the output; sensitive = gold tier above 'none'. Over-redaction lowers precision.",
